## 9. Tests
HMAC (valid, bad sig, stale), duplicate events, ownership (edge cannot set `shore_status`), forbidden keys rejected (contract), pull cursor paging, k ≥ 5 on wellbeing, signed URLs only for targeted vessels, video > 6 s rejected, audit rows written, reviewer cannot see any crew identifier (scan responses for `crew_id`, names from the roster).
